      "message": "Yes.  Would we be perfectly happy running with 15 W from a charger, or would we prefer to have more power (to charge the battery, for example)?  \n\nThis won\u0027t matter for most chargers/docks, just ones that are trying to ration power out to partners.  Some power schemes won\u0027t offer any more power unless the partner reports a \"mismatch\" with their given power.  We can revisit this later though if we\u0027re not sure since it wouldn\u0027t come into play until we test versus a partner that\u0027s being stingy with its wattage.",
